 1922 A:d392  e8                                 inx                    ;DECR DUE TO CARRY, AND
 1923 A:d393  c6 64                              dec INDEX2+1          ;DECREMENT STORE SO CARRY WORKS.
 1924 A:d395                           QDECT1    
