 1985 A:d3fa                                    ;
 1986 A:d3fa                                    ; CHEAD GOES THROUGH PROGRAM STORAGE AND FIXES
 1987 A:d3fa                                    ; UP ALL THE LINKS. THE END OF EACH LINE IS FOUND
 1988 A:d3fa                                    ; BY SEARCHING FOR THE ZERO AT THE END.
 1989 A:d3fa                                    ; THE DOUBLE ZERO LINK IS USED TO DETECT THE END OF THE PROGRAM.
 1990 A:d3fa                                    ;
 1991 A:d3fa                           CHEAD     
