 2012 A:d41e                                    ;
 2013 A:d41e                                    ; THIS IS THE LINE INPUT ROUTINE.
 2014 A:d41e                                    ; IT READS CHARACTERS INTO BUF USING BACKARROW (UNDERSCORE, OR
 2015 A:d41e                                    ; SHIFT O) AS THE DELETE CHARACTER AND @ AS THE 
 2016 A:d41e                                    ; LINE DELETE CHARACTER. IF MORE THAN BUFLEN CHARACTERS
 2017 A:d41e                                    ; ARE TYPED, NO ECHOING IS DONE UNTIL A BACKARROW OR @ OR CR
 2018 A:d41e                                    ; IS TYPED. CONTROL-G WILL BE TYPED FOR EACH EXTRA CHARACTER.
 2019 A:d41e                                    ; THE ROUTINE IS ENTERED AT INLIN.
 2020 A:d41e                                    ;

