 2497 A:d5fa                                    ; THE LINE NUMBER OF THE "FOR" STATEMENT 2 BYTES
 2498 A:d5fa                                    ; A TEXT POINTER INTO THE "FOR" STATEMENT 2 BYTES
 2499 A:d5fa                                    ; HIGH ADDRESS
