 3653 A:da8f                                    ;
 3654 A:da8f                                    ; IN THE PROCESSING OF DATA AND READ STATEMENTS:
 3655 A:da8f                                    ; ONE POINTER POINTS TO THE DATA (IE, THE NUMBERS BEING FETCHED)
 3656 A:da8f                                    ; AND ANOTHER POINTS TO THE LIST OF VARIABLES.
 3657 A:da8f                                    ;
 3658 A:da8f                                    ; THE POINTER INTO THE DATA ALWAYS STARTS POINTING TO A
 3659 A:da8f                                    ; TERMINATOR -- A , : OR END-OF-LINE.
 3660 A:da8f                                    ;
 3661 A:da8f                                    ; AT THIS POINT TXTPTR POINTS TO LIST OF VARIABLES AND
 3662 A:da8f                                    ; [Y,X] POINTS TO DATA OR INPUT LINE.
 3663 A:da8f                                    ;

