 5629 A:e4db                                    ; CHR$(#) CREATES A STRING WHICH CONTAINS AS ITS ONLY
 5630 A:e4db                                    ; CHARACTER THE ASCII EQUIVALENT OF THE INTEGER ARGUMENT (#)
 5631 A:e4db                                    ; WHICH MUST BE .LT. 255.
