 5763 A:e59c                                    ;
 5764 A:e59c                                    ; THE "VAL" FUNCTION TAKES A STRING AND TURNS IT INTO
 5765 A:e59c                                    ; A NUMBER BY INTERPRETING THE ASCII DIGITS ETCQ
 5766 A:e59c                                    ; EXCEPT FOR THE PROBLEM THAT A TERMINATOR MUST BE SUPPLIED
 5767 A:e59c                                    ; BY REPLACING THE CHARACTER BEYOND THE STRING, VAL IS MERELY
